# AI Orbit Tools — Environment Variables

## Frontend (Vercel Environment Variables)
# Set these in Vercel project settings > Environment Variables

# The URL of the backend API service (required for Vercel multi-service)
# On local development, defaults to "/api" (same-origin with Vite proxy)
# On Vercel, set this to your backend service URL, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-service.vercel.app
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
